[0.63927, "o", "==> Booting Flatcar (Ctrl-A X to quit QEMU)\r\n    kubeadm init runs automatically once Ignition + systemd-sysext finish.\r\n    Once you see a login prompt, SSH in from another terminal with:\r\n      ssh -i ssh/demo_ed25519 -o StrictHostKeyChecking=no -o UserKnownHostsFile=/dev/null -p 2222 core@localhost\u001b[9;1H"]
